        <h2>Worship rooted in Scripture</h2>
        <p>At Bethlehem, the Bible comes first. Our preaching is grounded in Scripture, and our worship carries on a tradition of singing the hymns of faith together &mdash; because in many ways, our congregation <em>is</em> our choir.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:12px;">If you're looking for a church home that holds fast to God's Word and still loves to sing the old songs, you'll find it here.</p>
