        <h2>We are the church</h2>
        <p>Bethlehem is a warm and authentic community &mdash; one that leaves the world better than we found it. From packing nearly 40,000 meals through Food for Kidz in 2025 to hosting neighbors at Trunk or Treat, service isn't something we talk about. It's something we do.</p>
